          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "silutwe Magadieli, silutwe Iramu. Mbaabo basilutwe ba-Edomu (ngonguwe Esau wisi ba-Edomu) mumakalilo aabo munyika njebakavubide.",
          "type": "text",
